  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Game.Narrative.NoteDefinition
  title: "Tesis 4 \u2014 Denek Bilgilendirme Formu"
  body: "Bulundu\u011Funuz alan bir deney odas\u0131d\u0131r.\n\nOda kap\u0131s\u0131, kontrol d\xFC\u011Fmesi yaln\u0131zca bas\u0131l\u0131 tutuldu\u011Fu s\xFCrece a\xE7\u0131k kal\u0131r.\n\nDeney s\xFCresince tahliye gaz\u0131 devreye girebilir. Panik yapmay\u0131n.\n\nHer denemeniz kay\u0131t alt\u0131ndad\u0131r."
  style: 0
